corresponding to the positive eigenvalue.

For this case, my initial conditions were
\[
(-6,-1.3),\quad(-5,0),\quad(-4.5,0.2),\quad(-7,-0.8).
\]
All four trajectories eventually passed the cutoff instead of
remaining near the equilibrium. This only describes the points
